          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, mwana womundu, sungana nabeinzu yaIsiraeli, nobasunjila ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Mukano khandi abaseenywe banyechile, nibakholela akobukhayi. ",
          "type": "text",
