            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba olwa ndali nimbeenjisiye mushibala tsana eshia ndachinguula amakhono ninditsuba ndakhabaheelesia, bahenjelesia buli shikulu eshirambi nabuli musaala omutendeemu, nibamalilayo emisango chiabwe, khandi ebweneyo nibahaanilayo ebihaanwa biabwe biobusinyisii; khandi ebweneyo nibatuumilia isiakakha yabwe, nibatsushiilila emisango chiabwe echiokhutsushila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nimbareeba mbu Habundu yaho aheechingu aha mutsiitsanga halangwa harie? Iiho nihalangwa mbu Bamal okhuula olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako osunjile abeinzu yaIsiraeli ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Kho mwiyonoonia shinga abaseenywe olwa beeyonoonia noho? Khandi mutsia mubuheyi bwokhulonda ebisinyo biabwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa muba nimuhaana ebihaanwa bieenywe, nimubisia abaana beenywe mumulilo, kho mwiyonooninjia nemindu chieenywe chiosi echia mwinamilanga, okhuula olwa leelo. Nasi ndakhanyala okhureebungwa nineenyu, noho, inywe abeinzu yaIsiraeli? Isie uno! Omwami NYASAYE aboola, Shinyala okhureebwakhwo nineenyu ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka mupaaranga mumioyo chieeny ve shlkeetsa okhwikhola ta; olwa muboolanga mbu Khulaba shinga amahanga, shinga tsimbia etsiomubialo, okhwinamila ebiemisaala namachina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie uno! Omwami NYASAYE aboola, Nomukhono kwamaani, nomukhono okunyiililwe, nobululu obusundulwa, ndalaba omuruchi oumuruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalamurusia mumbia tsiabandu nimukhung'aasia okhurula mubialo ebia mwasalaasibwamwo, nomukhono kwamaani, nomukhono okunyiililwe, nobululu obusundulwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimuyila mushitsiimi shietsimbia tsana, ninyenesanila nineenyu ebweneyo, mumoni khumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shinga olwa ndeenesana nabakuuka beenywe mushitsiimi shieshialo shiaMisiri, nolwa ndaleenesana nineenyu, Omwami NYASAYE aboola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalamubisilia hasi weindabushi, nimwinjisia nimubasia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimusiiyila elala nirusia mwinywe abeinduli, nende abo abakhayanga; ndalabarusia mushialo eshia bamenyangamwo, nebutswa shibaleenjila mushialo shiaIsiraeli ta; mana mulamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neenyu, inywe abeinzu yaIsiraeli, kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Tsie, mukhalabanile buli mundu emindu echia yeenamilanga, kata bulaano kata nende olunyuma, nimuba nimurachama okhumbulila ta; ne shimuloonoonia eliira lianje litakatifu nebihaanwa bieenywe nemindu chieenywe echia mwinamilanga khandi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mulukulu lwanje olutakatifu, khubutenje bwolukulu lwaIsiraeli, Omwami NYASAYE aboola, Ebweneyo bosi abeinzu yaIsiraeli, bosi pe, balakhalabanilanga mushialo; ebweneyo newa ndalabafuchiilila, khandi ebweneyo newa ndaleenyela ebihaanwa bieenywe, nebihaanwa bieenywe ebikhulundu, nebindu bieenywe ebitakatifu biosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shinga isiakakha ndalamufuchiilila, olwa ndalamurusia mutsimbia tsiabandu, nimukhung'aasia nimurusia mubialo ebia mwasalaasibwamwo; nasi ndalalolosia obutakatifu bwanje mwinywe, mumoni tsiamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mulamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI, olwa ndalamwinjisia mushialo shiaIsiraeli, mushialo tsana eshia ndachinguula omukhono ninditsuba okhuheelesia abakuuka beenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebweneyo muleetsulila tsinjila tsieenywe, nende ebikhole bieenywe biosi ebia mweeyonoonia ninabio; ne muleesinya abeene, khulwa tsimbii tsieenywe tsiosi etsia mwakholilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mulamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI, olwa ndalaba nikholile khwinywe emilimo khu lwa eliira lianje; ne akakhoyela tsinjila tsieenywe tsimbii, kata akakhoyela ebikhole bieenywe ebimayaanu ta, iny ve abeinzu yaIsiraeli, Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulakusi obuyinga abeisautsi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liOMWAMI nilinzitsila, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana womundu, choomia tsimonitsio okhuhenga enasautsi, niwilwatsa enasautsi, nolakulila omutsuru kweshialo shiaNegebu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nosunjila omutsuru kwaNegebu ori Hulila likhuwa liOMWAMI; kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Lola, ndalahambilia omulilo mwiwe, nakwo kulalia buli musaala omutendeemu, nende buli musaala omuumu. Tsimemu tsiomulilo etsiatukhanga shitsilasimibwa ta; ne mumoni mwabandu bosi, okhurula esautsi okhuula enotsi, mulasambwa khulwatsio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abandu bosi balalola mbu isie OMWAMI nisie oukuhambiye; shikulasimibwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nisunga mbu E Omwami NYASAYE! Baboolanga khwisie mbu Ne shiali omucheli wetsinjelo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.49"
            ]
          }
        }
